{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>וזאת תורת האשם [this is the law of the guilt-offering].</b> I have already informed you of the difference between חטאת and אשם, even though Scripture says of a חטאת אשם and of an אשם חטאת. And the reason to mention this section is to mention the fats, which are not mentioned in the law of the חטאת."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:50.879186432Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}